#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:30
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The Social Desktop (Open Collaboration Services) settings module lets you "
"configure your user accounts for Open Collaboration Service Providers."
msgstr ""
"O módulo de configuración do Escritorio Social (Servizos Abertos de "
"Configuración) permítelle configurar as contas de usuario en provedores de "
"servizos abertos de colaboración."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:33
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"At the time of writing <ulink url=\"http://opendesktop.org/\">openDesktop."
"org </ulink> is the first provider that you can use. You can use the web "
"site or this settings dialog to register and manage your account."
msgstr ""
"Cando se escribiu isto <ulink url=\"http://opendesktop.org/\">openDesktop."
"org</ulink> era o primeiro provedor que se podía usar. Pode usar o sitio web "
"ou este diálogo de configuración para rexistrarse e xestionar a conta."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:38
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "The benefit is that you can do more things in <quote>Get Hot New Stuff</"
#| "quote>: vote for items, become a fan of them and upload new content. A "
#| "configured account also allows you to use the social Plasma widgets "
#| "(<guilabel>Community</guilabel>, <guilabel>Social News</guilabel> &etc;) "
#| "to their full extent."
msgid ""
"The benefit is that you can do more things in <quote>Get Hot New Stuff</"
"quote>: vote for items, become a fan of them and upload new content. A "
"configured account also allows you to use the social Plasma widgets "
"(<quote>Community</quote>, <quote>Social News</quote> &etc;) to their full "
"extent."
msgstr ""
"O beneficio é que pode facer máis cousas en <quote>Obter novidades</quote>: "
"votar por cousas, facerse fan delas e enviar contido. Unha conta tamén lle "
"ha permitir usar os widgets sociais de Plasma (<guilabel>Comunidade</"
"guilabel>, <guilabel>Noticias sociais</guilabel> &etc;) en toda a súa "
"funcionalidade."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:44
#, no-c-format
msgid "Using the &systemsettings; module:"
msgstr "Uso do módulo de &systemsettings;:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:46
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can select which provider to configure at the top. Either enter your "
"existing user name and password to let &kde; use them. You can verify that "
"these work by using the <guibutton>Test Login</guibutton> button"
msgstr ""
"Pode escoller na parte de riba o provedor que queira configurar. Insira o "
"seu nome de usuario e o contrasinal para permitirlle a &kde; usalos. Pode "
"verificar que funcionan co botón <guibutton>Probar o acceso</guibutton>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:55
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If you do not have an account yet, use the <guilabel>Register</guilabel> "
"tab. Here you need to fill out all fields. After clicking "
"<guibutton>Register...</guibutton> you will receive an email from the server "
"to activate your account."
msgstr ""
"Se aínda non ten unha conta, use a lapela <guilabel>Rexistrar</guilabel> "
"onde deberá preencher todos os campos. Despois de premer "
"<guibutton>Rexistrar…</guibutton> ha recibir un correo electrónico do "
"servidor para activar a conta."

